  ($qb$S02C04Q08$qb$, $qb$S02$qb$, $qb$C04$qb$, $qb$L+MM$qb$, $qb$Management in your organisation is able to retain high-performing employees:$qb$, $qb$Yes — high performers stay; the organisation has a strong record of retaining its best people$qb$, $qb$Mostly — most high performers stay but there are notable exceptions that management acknowledges$qb$, $qb$Partially — losing high performers is a recognised and recurring management problem$qb$, $qb$No — high performer attrition is a significant and unresolved challenge$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
