  ($qb$S02C05Q01$qb$, $qb$S02$qb$, $qb$C05$qb$, $qb$MM+E$qb$, $qb$The general level of trust employees in your organisation have in their immediate manager is:$qb$, $qb$High — most employees trust their manager to act in their interest and be honest with them$qb$, $qb$Moderate — trust is present but conditional; it has been tested by past experiences$qb$, $qb$Low — a significant portion of employees do not trust their immediate manager$qb$, $qb$Very low — distrust between employees and managers is a dominant feature of this organisation$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
