  ($qb$S03C05Q06$qb$, $qb$S03$qb$, $qb$C05$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$Diversity and inclusion outcomes in your organisation (representation at leadership level, pay equity, inclusion survey scores) are:$qb$, $qb$Tracked, reported transparently, and improving — D&I is managed as a business outcome, not a compliance activity$qb$, $qb$Tracked and reported — data is available but progress is slow$qb$, $qb$Tracked but not improving — data exists but does not translate into meaningful change$qb$, $qb$Not tracked — D&I outcomes are not measured systematically$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
